dssat-pdi-rl for Debian

DSSAT modification for gym-DSSAT RL environment.

DSSAT + PDI is a modification of the Decision Support System for
Agrotechnology Transfer (DSSAT) software, which is the core of an Open
AI gym crop management Reinforcement Learning environment named
gym-DSSAT.

DSSAT + PDI is powered by the PDI Data Interface (PDI), that allows
loose coupling between the original Fortran code and Python.

